1
00:00:15,963 --> 00:00:16,963
We missed the last bus

2
00:00:18,315 --> 00:00:19,315
Did you know that?

3
00:00:22,064 --> 00:00:24,494
He only gives me
one-word answers

4
00:00:24,577 --> 00:00:25,747
and ignores me

5
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:27,111
like I'm not there

6
00:00:27,806 --> 00:00:28,806
And that face…

7
00:00:29,284 --> 00:00:30,284
Don't tell me…

8
00:00:30,569 --> 00:00:32,074
Is he so mad
that I fell asleep

9
00:00:32,157 --> 00:00:33,157
he won't talk to me?

10
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,202
He's the one
who missed the bus

11
00:00:36,015 --> 00:00:38,539
I get nervous
when I'm around him

12
00:00:39,248 --> 00:00:40,248
This won't do

13
00:00:40,572 --> 00:00:42,532
I need to change
my approach

14
00:00:45,154 --> 00:00:46,154
Hey

15
00:00:46,730 --> 00:00:47,730
Hyeon-wu

16
00:00:49,076 --> 00:00:50,076
Lee Hyeon-wu!

17
00:00:51,762 --> 00:00:52,762
Hey!

18
00:00:54,096 --> 00:00:55,096
Hey!

19
00:00:56,174 --> 00:00:58,673
At least pretend
to listen!

20
00:00:58,756 --> 00:01:00,023
Look me in the face!

21
00:01:00,477 --> 00:01:02,447
You're completely
ignoring me

22
00:01:03,564 --> 00:01:05,882
I need to make
a risky move

23
00:01:06,984 --> 00:01:09,332
Of course, you won't know
until you try

24
00:01:10,153 --> 00:01:11,633
Is it my fault
that we missed the bus?

25
00:01:12,043 --> 00:01:13,043
Is it?

26
00:01:13,116 --> 00:01:14,992
Is it my fault
you a**hole?

27
00:01:15,751 --> 00:01:17,404
I don't care
if he beats me up

28
00:01:17,487 --> 00:01:19,586
I just have to express
my opinion

29
00:01:19,669 --> 00:01:21,823
That was
my biggest mistake

30
00:01:21,906 --> 00:01:24,511
If I had stood up
to Hyeong-ju

31
00:01:24,594 --> 00:01:26,713
I wouldn't have
to do something crazy

32
00:01:26,796 --> 00:01:27,796
Sorry

33
00:01:29,147 --> 00:01:30,147
Huh?

34
00:01:30,990 --> 00:01:32,593
Staying up all night
like this

35
00:01:33,770 --> 00:01:35,262
made me
overthink things

36
00:01:35,928 --> 00:01:37,079
I'm sorry if you're upset

37
00:01:37,162 --> 00:01:38,162
Huh?

38
00:01:39,358 --> 00:01:41,859
Normally, I would've
just brushed it off

39
00:01:41,942 --> 00:01:43,604
but seeing him angry
made me feel

40
00:01:43,687 --> 00:01:45,079
anxious. But why?

41
00:01:45,952 --> 00:01:47,983
It's like I don't want him
to hate me

42
00:01:48,066 --> 00:01:49,275
He apologized

43
00:01:50,110 --> 00:01:51,539
Does that mean

44
00:01:51,622 --> 00:01:54,196
we're equal now?

45
00:01:54,622 --> 00:01:56,224
Can I finally escape

46
00:01:56,326 --> 00:01:57,650
Hyeong-ju's
bullying now?

47
00:01:57,733 --> 00:01:58,733
Hey, Hong Il-tak

48
00:02:06,695 --> 00:02:07,895
Take out
all the money you have
